{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs34 commonnote-reaper\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 ReaScripts for supporting {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/ExpressiveLabs/commonnote"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
commonnote
}}}
 as a cross-application copy paste specification.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs34 Installation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 1.\tab} Install {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://reapack.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
ReaPack
}}}
.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 2.\tab} Open REAPER and go to Extensions > ReaPack > Import repositories...\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 3.\tab} Paste this URL: https://github.com/UtaUtaUtau/commonnote-reaper/raw/main/index.xml\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 4.\tab} Go to Extensions > ReaPack > Browse packages...\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 5.\tab} Search for SWS/S&M extensions and install it.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 6.\tab} Search for commonnote-reaper and install all the packages listed.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 7.\tab} Restart REAPER.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360\ls1\ilvl0\tx360 {\listtext\tab 8.\tab} (Optional) Bind a keybind to both actions.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360\ls2\ilvl1\tx360 {\listtext\tab \endash \tab} Ctrl + Alt + Shift + C/V is free in REAPER's default keybinds.\sa180\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs34 Extra\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \fs24 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This project includes {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/rxi/json.lua"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
json.lua
}}}
 in its entirety for JSON encoding/decoding.\par}
}
